    }
   },
   {
    "type": "Blog.Section",
    "id": "f7604b78-7fd0-4251-a707-3c7d0f95df8e",
    "defaultValue": null,
    "component": {
     "type": "RichText",
     "id": "a791c376-7280-4573-a797-54e33ae4cb16",
     "defaultValue": false,
     "value": "<p class=\" s1 li1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Créer des transitions fluides et naturelles</strong></p>",
     "backupValue": null,
     "version": 1,
     "wrapperClass": "s-narrow-margin"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "Blog.Section",
    "id": "ecf7a668-9eeb-4911-86fc-038b1f47082a",
    "defaultValue": null,
    "component": {
     "type": "RichText",
     "id": "c449a08a-e68e-46ae-a819-da014c4eb026",
     "defaultValue": false,
     "value": "<p class=\" s1 li1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Le timing ne se résume pas à une heure sur un planning. Il s’agit avant tout de ressenti. Un bon DJ sait :</p>",
     "backupValue": null,
     "version": 1,
     "wrapperClass": "s-narrow-margin"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "Blog.Section",
    "id": "d56c72d6-91c9-4d72-bde0-c70f3545d31a",
    "defaultValue": null,
    "component": {
     "type": "RichText",
     "id": "87737de5-b3cd-4458-9a8b-19c0e0c4fa47",
     "defaultValue": false,
     "value": "<p class=\" p2\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">- prolonger un moment quand l’émotion est à son apogée,</p>",
     "backupValue": null,
     "version": 1,
     "wrapperClass": "s-narrow-margin"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "Blog.Section",
    "id": "58a4440a-2574-48e1-a155-bdd82b8f9f80",
    "defaultValue": null,
    "component": {
     "type": "RichText",
     "id": "0cc6c508-562b-4fe0-a795-abd75ee359ce",
     "defaultValue": false,
     "value": "<p class=\" p1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">- accélérer le rythme lorsque l’énergie du public le demande,</p>",
     "backupValue": null,
     "version": 1,
     "wrapperClass": "s-narrow-margin"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "Blog.Section",
    "id": "fbfabab3-35bb-4469-855f-aa6cb4e8319a",
    "defaultValue": null,
    "component": {
     "type": "RichText",
     "id": "66b6896d-07f2-425f-bdbe-271b9b38cd16",
     "defaultValue": false,
     "value": "<p class=\" p1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">- préparer les invités à un temps fort sans jamais les brusquer.</p>",
     "backupValue": null,
     "version": 1,
     "wrapperClass": "s-narrow-margin"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "Blog.Section",
    "id": "20af069e-eaea-4004-9032-37e1ba156275",
    "defaultValue": null,
    "component": {
     "type": "RichText",
     "id": "f8064d40-be92-4243-b3c3-364151816344",
     "defaultValue": false,
     "value": "<p class=\" p3\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">La musique devient alors un outil de narration, qui guide les invités tout au long de la soirée.</p>",
     "backupValue": null,
     "version": 1,
     "wrapperClass": "s-narrow-margin"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "Blog.Section",
    "id": "f1aae086-1858-4c63-9262-d9848077df23",
    "defaultValue": null,
    "component": {
     "type": "RichText",
     "id": "37181651-f08f-4604-93c2-5d3c5f2cad60",
     "defaultValue": false,
     "value": "<p class=\" p1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br></p>",
     "backupValue": null,
     "version": 1,
     "wrapperClass": "s-narrow-margin"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "Blog.Section",
    "id": "8d545b5f-7281-4699-9ea5-e18a618b47fb",
    "defaultValue": null,
    "component": {
     "type": "RichText",
     "id": "406757be-ae8c-40d5-b464-d340daddb36d",
     "defaultValue": false,
     "value": "<p class=\" s1 li1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>S’adapter en permanence à l’énergie de la salle</strong></p>",
     "backupValue": null,
     "version": 1,
     "wrapperClass": "s-narrow-margin"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "Blog.Section",
    "id": "333a7dd6-fc36-4bbe-bb47-e25f4a1588a1",
    "defaultValue": null,
    "component": {
     "type": "RichText",
     "id": "c73d2a86-0dea-4335-9af5-902d567b25d6",
     "defaultValue": false,
     "value": "<p class=\" s1 li1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Aucun événement ne se déroule exactement comme prévu. Le DJ est là pour lire la salle, observer les réactions, ressentir l’ambiance et ajuster le déroulé en conséquence. Un discours qui se prolonge, une piste de danse qui s’enflamme plus tôt que prévu, un moment d’émotion imprévu… Le DJ adapte le timing en temps réel pour que tout reste fluide, naturel et cohérent.</p>",
     "backupValue": null,
     "version": 1,
     "wrapperClass": "s-narrow-margin"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "Blog.Section",
    "id": "7378ee42-30c0-4af2-90cb-daaace53e4f4",
    "defaultValue": null,
    "component": {
     "type": "RichText",
     "id": "ce6dd71d-ea9d-4880-9573-916d7b06220b",
     "defaultValue": false,
     "value": "<p class=\" p1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br></p>",
     "backupValue": null,
     "version": 1,
     "wrapperClass": "s-narrow-margin"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "Blog.Section",
    "id": "cca900aa-3a3e-4c58-b213-c650ddab7655",
    "defaultValue": null,
    "component": {
